### Additional Terms & Telemetry Disclosure

#### 1. Runtime Usage & Download Telemetry
The Software includes native, privacy-preserving runtime usage and distribution download telemetry:
- **Download & Update Tracking**: The Software logs release verification queries and asset download events (version tags, download completion status, byte sizes, and duration) to measure distribution reach and update health.
- **Runtime Execution Statistics**: The Software monitors non-identifiable usage statistics including application launch counts, active session duration, total runtime uptime, macOS operating system version, and system architecture (Apple Silicon arm64 vs Intel x86_64).
- **No Personally Identifiable Information (PII)**: The Software does NOT harvest, transmit, or retain personal identities, names, email addresses, IP addresses, persistent hardware serial numbers, file paths, open document contents, or network packet payloads.
- **User Transparency & Opt-Out**: Users may inspect collected telemetry events in raw JSON format, clear telemetry history, or permanently disable all runtime usage and download telemetry at any time via `Settings -> General -> Runtime Usage & Download Telemetry`.
